+/* Staged-combustion (topping) closure: the preburner exhaust expands through the
+ * turbine and is injected into the main chamber instead of being exhausted
+ * overboard, so external flow and branch thrust are zero and the main nozzle
+ * carries the full propellant flow. Requires return_fraction == 1 and a turbine
+ * discharge pressure at least return_pressure_drop_pa above chamber pressure.
+ * Feed split, pumps, preburner, turbine and shaft closure follow the
+ * prescribed-state method and the chamber state stays PRESCRIBED, so this is
+ * still bookkeeping, not an adiabatic closure. branch_area_ratio and
+ * branch_axial_projection are inactive. Every failure leaves output unchanged. */
+RpStatus rp_cycle_solve_staged(const RpCycleInput *input,
+                               const RpRootOptions *options,
